{"id":"gesundheit","lemma":"Gesundheit","pos":"noun","rank":1861,"glosses":["health (state of being in good physical condition and free from illness)","health; soundness; strength; stability (state of being in good condition)"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈzʊnthaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/De-Gesundheit2.ogg/De-Gesundheit2.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Gesundheit"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich nehme meine Gesundheit ernst.","en":"I take my health seriously.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"serious, severe, grave"}]},{"text":"Unsere Gesundheit ist sehr wichtig.","en":"Our health is very important.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"important"}]},{"text":"Ich war um seine Gesundheit besorgt.","en":"I was worried about his health.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/787686","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"worried"}]},{"text":"Mein Vater ist bei guter Gesundheit.","en":"My father is in good health.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"at / with"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Gesundheit ist das Wichtigste.","en":"Health is the most important thing.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"important","l":"wichtig"}]}]}